  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">COVID-19 Prevention and Response Measures within the Migration Response in Bosnia and Herzegovina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project supports the BiH authorities in their COVID-19 prevention and response. This will be achieved by reducing COVID-19 infection risks among the migrant and asylum-seeking population and preparing national authorities to include migrants within the COVID-19 vaccination programme.</narrative>
  </description>
